	L["The sound finder lets you find the file ID of a sound that is playing in game.|n|nPlay the sound you want to find and click the start button.  Each step mutes half of the remaining sound files.  Click the heard button if you can still hear the sound or the silent button if you cannot.|n|nFor sound effects (such as an ability or emote), play the sound again after each step.  For music or ambience, click the sound system restart button after each step.|n|nWhen the sound file is found, its ID is shown in the editbox on the right so that you can copy it."] = "声音查找器可以帮你找到游戏中正在播放的声音的文件ID。|n|n播放你想查找的声音，然后点击开始按钮。  每一步都会静音剩余声音文件的一半。  如果你仍能听到声音，请点击'听到了'按钮，否则请点击'静音'按钮。|n|n对于音效（如技能或表情），请在每一步后重新播放该声音。  对于音乐或环境音，请在每一步后点击重启声音系统按钮。|n|n找到声音文件后，其ID会显示在右侧的输入框中，以便你复制。"
